<title>USA: Bon-Ton Stores Jan same-store sales rose. [CORRECTED 18:13 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bon-Ton Stores Jan same-store sales rose. [CORRECTED 18:13 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	   Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	    $27.8	 $NA	    +14.7	+19.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $626.5	 $NA	     +4.1	 +4.2</p>
<p>(Corrects Year-to date 1997 figure from $218.1 to $626.5, total percentage change from +4.8 to +4.1 and same-store percentage change from +9.2 to +4.2. Also corrects column headers from &quot;1996&quot; and &quot;1995&quot; to &quot;1997&quot; and &quot;1996&quot;.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is Jan weeks ended Feb 1.</p>
<p>Full company name is Bon-Ton Stores Inc</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
